WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:05.216
Every second, businesses make thousands of digital connections.

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:07.180
People access systems.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.437
Applications communicate.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:11.215
Customers move money.

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:14.596
And AI is changing how work gets done.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:19.450
But a successful login doesn't guarantee continuous trust.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:22.851
Identity risk can change throughout a session.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:30.268
Understanding who is accessing what, how they behave, and when that behaviour changes, is essential.

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:38.125
adapID AI. Continuous Identity Risk Management.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.223
Identities aren't limited to people.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:47.362
Applications, workloads and services have identities of their own.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:53.595
Their permissions and access relationships can create risks that are difficult to see.

00:00:57.100 --> 00:01:02.703
adapID AI. Non-Human Identity Security for AWS.

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:09.471
In financial services, even valid credentials can hide a fraudulent interaction.

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:19.345
Protecting customers means looking beyond the login, and understanding the identity and behaviour behind the transaction.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:25.482
adapID AI. Identity Fraud Prevention.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:31.341
And as organisations embrace AI, another challenge emerges.

00:01:31.600 --> 00:01:37.567
Employees need the power of AI without exposing sensitive business information.

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:42.239
Security must become part of the interaction itself.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:46.380
Zenstra AI. Secure AI Interactions.

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:54.330
Because the future of business depends on identities we can understand, interactions we can trust, and technology we can secure.

00:01:54.350 --> 00:02:00.129
Deep Algorithms Solutions. Securing identity and AI in the connected world.
